From: Leo <you@playtestpulse.dev>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 22:26:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Events table columns + sort + column toggle, Connection tab,
 events-over-time chart, auto-summarize

- Events tab (renamed from Live stream): Time / Player / Server ID / Event / Data columns
  with a header row, click-to-sort Time/Server/Event (asc/desc arrow), and a
  Columns settings menu to show/hide columns (persisted in localStorage).
- Connection panel moved to its own tab.
- Overall: added an events-over-time SVG area chart (respects the date range).
- Feedback summary auto-runs when a game opens or the page reloads; button still re-runs it.
- db.js: stats.overview now returns a bucketed time series for the chart.
